<title>GERMANY: Buba revises Dec Pan-German industry orders down.</title>
<headline>Buba revises Dec Pan-German industry orders down.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS   Dec 96	   Nov 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -1.8 (-1.4)    -0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +2.0 (+2.4)    +2.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    96.3 (96.7)    98.1</p>
